				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Snorkel in Cozumel with Clear Boat</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3aa587c2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3aa587c2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									The coral reef is one of the biggest attractions on the island of Cozumel. A glass boat and the clear waters of the Caribbean, you can admire it. In the course of 1 hour and a half, we will take you through the most beautiful of the crystal clear waters of Cozumel, where you will have the opportunity to delight yourself with coral formations, marine life, a sunken ship, the most emblematic places of the island, its history and last but not least you will have the fortune of traveling on the first transparent boat in the Mexican Caribbean.								</div>
